        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 8:32PM PDT until September 26 at 3:00PM PDT by NWS San Francisco CA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northwest winds 15 to 25 kt with gusts up to 30 kt
expected.

* WHERE...Waters from Point Pinos to Point Piedras Blancas 10-
60 NM.

* WHEN...Until 3 PM PDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
